WEBVTT

00:09.360 --> 00:11.360
So you're going to school today?

00:11.780 --> 00:15.240
I can't take sick leave forever.

00:15.780 --> 00:16.870
Were you sick?

00:17.330 --> 00:18.950
That's the excuse I gave them.

00:19.410 --> 00:22.500
You didn't have to mind me.

00:23.080 --> 00:25.330
I did it because I wanted to.

00:29.050 --> 00:31.050
Might you have come to like me?

00:31.050 --> 00:31.710
Wha-?

00:32.010 --> 00:33.880
But no doing perverted stuff.

00:34.930 --> 00:35.760
Why would I?

00:37.760 --> 00:40.720
Then I'll be waiting here, getting dinner ready for you.

00:42.600 --> 00:47.060
Make yourself at home, but you don't need to do anything in particular.

00:47.310 --> 00:50.440
Why? I want to repay your generosity.

00:50.940 --> 00:53.990
Every time you get excited, more things go wrong.

00:54.650 --> 00:59.580
The microwave, the electric kettle and the air conditioner all broke down by themselves!

00:59.700 --> 01:01.330
You treated them too roughly!

01:01.540 --> 01:03.620
I didn't think I used that much force...

01:03.790 --> 01:06.420
You hardly need to use any force at all!

01:06.620 --> 01:09.130
The machines nowadays are so frail.

01:11.340 --> 01:14.220
It's okay, so please, just be patient.

01:14.920 --> 01:15.510
Okay.

01:18.720 --> 01:20.050
I'll be going then.

01:24.930 --> 01:26.350
Perfect timing.

01:26.600 --> 01:29.150
I came to see you since you aren't answering your cell.

01:30.400 --> 01:31.070
Don't look!

01:31.070 --> 01:31.730
At what?

01:31.820 --> 01:32.780
"At what?"

01:39.070 --> 01:40.120
No fever.

01:41.530 --> 01:42.950
Now come on, let's dash!

01:43.240 --> 01:45.080
Don't ask so much of an invalid.

01:45.290 --> 01:47.040
You're just playing sick as usual anyways.

02:13.270 --> 02:19.690
hane ga shiroku hikari mabushiku tondeyuku

02:13.270 --> 02:19.690
White feathers gleam and fly away brightly

02:20.110 --> 02:26.740
kokoro dake nosete hoshii no ni

02:20.110 --> 02:26.740
Though I only want to set my heart on them

02:27.740 --> 02:34.000
tsumetai te wo nobasu todokanai... shitteru

02:27.740 --> 02:34.000
I extend my cold hands - They won't reach... I know

02:34.630 --> 02:41.720
dakedo ima furetai kimi ni

02:34.630 --> 02:41.720
But I want to touch you now

02:41.880 --> 02:47.850
natsukashii kaze ni ha ano koro no fune

02:41.880 --> 02:47.850
On that nostalgic wind - A ship from the past

02:48.260 --> 02:56.270
maboroshi ga omoide wo miseta

02:48.260 --> 02:56.270
An illusion showed me memories

02:57.340 --> 03:06.280
"wasurenai" dareka no koe ga setsunaku hibiku

02:57.340 --> 03:06.280
"I won't forget" Someone's voice echoes painfully

03:06.450 --> 03:11.370
hajimaru yokan ni furuete

03:06.450 --> 03:11.370
Trembling with a foreboding

03:11.660 --> 03:19.710
"wasuretai" negau jibun ga wakaranai

03:11.660 --> 03:19.710
"I want to forget" I cannot understand myself for hoping so

03:20.090 --> 03:29.430
matteiru yurarenagara yume hitotsu wo

03:20.090 --> 03:29.430
I shall wait while swaying, for that one dream

03:37.130 --> 03:42.060
A Peaceful Day

03:45.370 --> 03:46.790
It's not this one.

03:48.880 --> 03:49.960
You have terrible taste.

03:50.250 --> 03:51.170
Sorry.

03:51.670 --> 03:57.260
I think Yorito-san's taste is sophisticated and avant-garde.

03:57.470 --> 03:59.760
No need to comfort me, Koyori-chan.

04:01.810 --> 04:04.140
Bye sis. I'll come by again.

04:05.690 --> 04:07.270
You just got here!

04:07.440 --> 04:08.610
Do you have something to do?

04:09.230 --> 04:11.110
It's not like that, but...

04:14.700 --> 04:15.360
S-Sis?

04:15.360 --> 04:16.530
S-Sis?

04:24.960 --> 04:27.750
You didn't have to leave with me.

04:28.130 --> 04:29.290
I have to work.

04:29.880 --> 04:30.670
I see.

04:32.920 --> 04:33.420
Weird...

04:34.590 --> 04:36.010
Something's wrong with you.

04:36.340 --> 04:38.430
N-Nothing's wrong with me.

04:38.890 --> 04:39.970
Even this morning...

04:40.550 --> 04:41.100
W-What?

04:41.100 --> 04:41.970
W-What?

04:42.390 --> 04:44.430
You seemed flustered.

04:45.730 --> 04:47.640
She's good at noticing details you don't want.

04:47.940 --> 04:48.690
I-It's nothing.

04:48.690 --> 04:49.940
I-It's nothing.

04:50.610 --> 04:52.570
Is it something you can't even tell Aono-san?

04:53.360 --> 04:54.650
What do you mean?

04:54.650 --> 04:56.650
You're hiding something from me, aren't you?!

04:56.900 --> 04:57.740
I'm not!

05:01.870 --> 05:05.160
Even if I were, there's no reason for you to suspect me.

05:05.870 --> 05:07.080
Since I'm not!

05:08.000 --> 05:08.750
Bye!

05:11.250 --> 05:12.380
Suspicious.

05:26.020 --> 05:28.890
A kid's special would suit you better.

05:29.850 --> 05:31.940
I don't like that joke. I'm tired of it.

05:33.230 --> 05:34.150
Instead...

05:35.730 --> 05:38.110
Have you been thinking of what to do for now?

05:39.450 --> 05:40.910
What should we do...?

05:41.280 --> 05:42.570
You haven't thought of anything?

05:43.580 --> 05:45.450
We'll have to consider things for a while.

05:46.250 --> 05:47.410
For now, just eat.

05:47.910 --> 05:49.250
I will!

05:50.080 --> 05:51.330
Hey, you got some on your face.

05:54.590 --> 05:56.460
Here's your coffee.

05:57.010 --> 05:58.010
Thanks.

05:58.300 --> 06:00.550
I'll go grab you a new napkin.

06:01.050 --> 06:01.680
Thanks.

06:02.550 --> 06:04.220
Having dinner with your daddy?

06:04.640 --> 06:05.470
Daddy?!

06:06.560 --> 06:08.230
Yeah. Something like that.

06:08.810 --> 06:11.900
He comes home late from work, so we end up having late dinners.

06:12.770 --> 06:13.610
I'm so ashamed.

06:14.770 --> 06:16.980
Your work must keep you busy then.

06:17.570 --> 06:19.030
He's bad at planning out his work.

06:19.610 --> 06:20.650
Very ashamed.

06:22.860 --> 06:25.830
You shouldn't say such things about your daddy.

06:26.330 --> 06:29.870
Men don't understand unless you're strict like this.

06:30.580 --> 06:32.040
Is that so?

06:32.540 --> 06:34.250
I really am ashamed.

06:35.710 --> 06:37.920
They must be a complicated family in many ways.

06:38.630 --> 06:41.090
It sure must be difficult.

06:41.340 --> 06:42.220
What is?

06:42.590 --> 06:46.890
To adopt an orphan and take care of her like that.

06:47.220 --> 06:49.550
Did you come up with that story just now?

06:49.550 --> 06:52.850
Oh, mysterious bearded dandy!

06:53.230 --> 06:55.560
Oh yeah, you like older men.

06:57.110 --> 06:58.690
Anyway, I'll be going now.

06:59.820 --> 07:01.400
You're not working overtime today?

07:01.650 --> 07:02.530
I'll pass.

07:02.740 --> 07:03.820
I have something to do.

07:04.990 --> 07:06.200
How rare.

07:06.490 --> 07:07.030
Bye.

07:11.120 --> 07:12.830
It's about a man, eh?

07:17.840 --> 07:21.210
Avocado Noodles

07:17.960 --> 07:18.630
Look!

07:18.630 --> 07:19.960
This just came out.

07:20.130 --> 07:21.210
Avocado flavor.

07:21.380 --> 07:23.050
Who would eat ramen like that?

07:23.970 --> 07:27.140
But it was on super-special-discount sale.

07:27.510 --> 07:29.720
They sold you the leftovers.

07:30.350 --> 07:31.930
I'm such a skilled shopper.

07:32.140 --> 07:33.480
I beg to differ.

07:33.940 --> 07:36.560
Besides, I told you that you didn't have to get dinner ready.

07:36.560 --> 07:39.650
That's because you came home late.

07:41.320 --> 07:42.570
How far did you go?

07:42.990 --> 07:44.700
To the supermarket in front of the station.

07:44.700 --> 07:46.280
You were walking outside again?

07:46.700 --> 07:49.490
It's okay when the sun's not out.

07:49.830 --> 07:53.160
That's not what I meant. I'm just saying that something might happen like last time.

07:53.160 --> 07:55.170
Then I might not have to be so bored.

07:55.460 --> 07:56.790
This is bad for my heart.

07:56.960 --> 07:58.340
You're so frail.

07:59.130 --> 08:01.000
No need to remind me.

08:03.470 --> 08:06.260
I'm just saying I'm worried about you.

08:07.090 --> 08:09.050
Pay attention when people are talking to you!

08:10.890 --> 08:11.890
It tastes awful.

08:12.140 --> 08:14.180
Of course it does.

08:16.350 --> 08:17.270
I wonder who that is.

08:17.690 --> 08:19.190
Might be the newspaper salesman.

08:19.820 --> 08:20.480
Why's that?

08:20.940 --> 08:24.190
I told him the homeowner would be home later.

08:24.190 --> 08:25.360
You answered the door?!

08:25.360 --> 08:26.820
Leave it to me.

08:26.820 --> 08:28.990
He also told me I was cute,

08:29.370 --> 08:30.780
and gave me some laundry detergent.

08:31.240 --> 08:33.500
He said it will get out even the toughest stains.

08:35.830 --> 08:37.000
Coming!

08:37.210 --> 08:38.830
Wait, hold on! I'll get it.

08:46.590 --> 08:48.050
Yeah, yeah. I'm coming.

08:52.180 --> 08:53.810
Why is the door locked?

08:54.520 --> 08:55.680
Don't you usually lock it?

08:56.230 --> 08:58.150
Your door hasn't been locked before.

08:58.480 --> 09:02.820
Oh, right! I heard that people are becoming more aware of security these days.

09:03.820 --> 09:04.820
Suspicious.

09:05.240 --> 09:06.570
You're suspecting too much.

09:06.990 --> 09:08.240
Well, whatever.

09:08.240 --> 09:09.570
You haven't had dinner, right?

09:09.780 --> 09:10.070
W-Wait, wait.

09:10.070 --> 09:10.660
W-Wait, wait.

09:10.660 --> 09:11.370
W-Wait, wait.

09:11.580 --> 09:13.160
Why are you so flustered?

09:13.580 --> 09:15.620
Why did you come today of all days?

09:16.040 --> 09:18.290
Because you've been acting strange lately.

09:18.290 --> 09:19.620
I'm not acting strange!

09:20.920 --> 09:23.090
You got to the hospital and then left right away.

09:23.420 --> 09:24.960
That's because I wasn't feel-

09:24.960 --> 09:26.470
All the more reason, then.

09:26.470 --> 09:28.510
I'll make something warm for you to eat.

09:28.720 --> 09:32.600
It's late now, so your folks must be worried.

09:32.930 --> 09:35.600
I'll leave as soon as I prepare dinner!

09:35.810 --> 09:37.810
I already ate, just now.

09:39.520 --> 09:40.900
You're such a liar.

09:41.230 --> 09:42.310
I'm coming in.

09:41.480 --> 09:42.310
Hey, hey!

09:42.310 --> 09:44.020
Hey, wait, Mana! Hey!

09:46.860 --> 09:49.150
What's this mountain of instant ramen for?

09:51.530 --> 09:53.200
Geez...

10:00.500 --> 10:02.380
Did Matsuri go upstairs?

10:03.290 --> 10:04.250
What are you doing?

10:05.550 --> 10:06.250
Well...

10:06.250 --> 10:09.050
I was just wondering if there'll be blue skies tomorrow.

10:13.180 --> 10:16.640
I don't come see you for a while and you've started eating instant ramen...

10:17.100 --> 10:18.850
The new ones these days taste really good.

10:19.060 --> 10:22.650
No way. You'll get sick from eating this junk.

10:23.230 --> 10:25.860
I'll cook you some proper food today.

10:26.150 --> 10:27.780
M-Make it quick please.

10:30.490 --> 10:31.360
Is something wrong?

10:31.860 --> 10:32.910
You're still acting strange.

10:33.530 --> 10:36.660
I-I guess it's because of the avocado ramen.

10:37.040 --> 10:38.910
How could it be that?

10:39.410 --> 10:40.250
W-What?

10:44.750 --> 10:46.800
How long are you going to stand there?

10:48.710 --> 10:49.630
Well...

10:52.590 --> 10:53.640
Why don't you sit down?

10:54.550 --> 10:55.350
Y-Yeah, I should.

10:55.350 --> 10:56.560
Y-Yeah, I should.

11:05.270 --> 11:07.690
Mana-san, the water has boiled!

11:13.450 --> 11:15.120
Is she Yorito's girlfriend?

11:34.840 --> 11:38.460
but my poor heart won't last long if this keeps up.

11:39.760 --> 11:42.680
Why am I so worked up in the first place?

11:44.220 --> 11:46.050
Yorito is dirty!

11:46.510 --> 11:47.560
Beast!

11:47.930 --> 11:49.020
I'll kill him.

11:51.180 --> 11:51.770
What?

11:51.940 --> 11:52.770
What happened?

11:55.400 --> 11:57.440
Oh, nothing.

11:59.070 --> 12:03.240
I can't have my sister worrying unnecessarily.

12:05.120 --> 12:05.910
What? What is it?

12:05.910 --> 12:06.830
What? What is it?

12:06.830 --> 12:09.950
Miso

12:06.830 --> 12:08.240
There's no soy sauce.

12:08.540 --> 12:09.950
Or any sugar or salt.

12:11.080 --> 12:12.330
Come to think of it...

12:13.370 --> 12:15.880
I spilled them earlier.

12:16.630 --> 12:19.050
There isn't any pepper, vinegar, or sauce either!

12:19.050 --> 12:21.190
I spilled those too.

12:21.300 --> 12:22.050
I-I spilled them earlier!

12:22.050 --> 12:23.760
I-I spilled them earlier!

12:23.760 --> 12:25.260
Then go buy more immediately.

12:25.260 --> 12:26.760
No, that's all right.

12:26.760 --> 12:27.640
That won't do.

12:27.930 --> 12:31.140
I'm going to make a delicious nikujaga for you.

12:31.520 --> 12:33.390
It'll work fine without the seasoning...

12:33.810 --> 12:36.100
But that just won't do.

12:36.100 --> 12:38.230
The supermarket is closed by now.

12:38.700 --> 12:41.070
There's still the convenience store in front of the station.

12:43.070 --> 12:44.070
That's true.

12:45.910 --> 12:47.870
So go buy them immediately, okay?

12:48.370 --> 12:49.910
Hey, wait!

12:51.950 --> 12:54.920
Matsuri, don't come out of hiding...

12:58.130 --> 12:59.840
Now then...

13:29.620 --> 13:32.790
I thought he was hiding something for sure.

13:44.340 --> 13:45.300
G-Good evening!

13:45.300 --> 13:46.470
G-Good evening!

13:47.010 --> 13:48.260
Good evening!

13:48.840 --> 13:50.050
Um... Who are you?

13:50.050 --> 13:50.930
Um... Who are you?

13:51.220 --> 13:52.850
Um...

13:57.140 --> 14:00.690
I see. You've been here for a week.

14:06.070 --> 14:07.360
Yes, about a week.

14:07.780 --> 14:10.030
What are you doing here?

14:10.200 --> 14:11.740
Let me see... Eating and sleeping?

14:11.740 --> 14:12.450
Let me see... Eating and sleeping?

14:13.830 --> 14:15.580
I'm very easygoing.

14:16.080 --> 14:17.870
Is that something you should say?

14:19.250 --> 14:21.130
What do you do about your clothes and stuff?

14:21.840 --> 14:24.590
Yorito prepares most of them, but...

14:24.880 --> 14:26.340
not the underwear.

14:27.510 --> 14:29.010
That'd be a problem.

14:29.380 --> 14:31.010
I hand-wash all of them every day.

14:31.550 --> 14:34.310
What do you do when you're washing them all?

14:35.220 --> 14:36.600
When I'm washing them...

14:37.350 --> 14:38.940
When you're washing them...

14:40.100 --> 14:42.690
It's a... se-cret.

14:48.360 --> 14:49.820
It's a secret?!

14:53.330 --> 14:54.490
It's all right.

14:55.160 --> 14:57.750
We don't do any perverted stuff, so don't worry.

14:58.080 --> 14:58.960
I see...

15:02.130 --> 15:03.000
He's back.

15:17.270 --> 15:18.310
Delicious!

15:18.730 --> 15:20.190
Care to explain?

15:21.190 --> 15:22.850
She's my cousin.

15:23.310 --> 15:24.150
I am?

15:25.020 --> 15:26.110
Yeah, you are!

15:26.110 --> 15:29.740
Oh, right. He's letting me stay here until I rent an apartment.

15:29.740 --> 15:30.860
Yes, something like that.

15:31.490 --> 15:33.160
Then why did you have to hide it?

15:34.910 --> 15:35.660
Well...

15:36.200 --> 15:38.370
Because I'm really shy.

15:38.620 --> 15:39.750
Yeah! That's it!

15:39.960 --> 15:43.500
You didn't have any trouble talking to me, and you've never met me before.

15:44.250 --> 15:46.590
A-Actually, I was really nervous.

15:46.590 --> 15:48.420
You didn't look it.

15:48.880 --> 15:50.130
I'm in trouble.

15:50.550 --> 15:52.260
I'm the one in trouble!

15:52.800 --> 15:55.640
We should have prepared for this earlier.

15:55.970 --> 15:57.390
You're telling me?!

15:57.390 --> 15:58.350
Matsuri-san?

15:58.600 --> 15:59.270
Yes?

16:01.140 --> 16:04.400
Honestly, what are you to Yorito?

16:17.120 --> 16:19.410
Come to think of it, what am I?

16:20.080 --> 16:22.370
You seriously didn't think about that?

16:22.580 --> 16:25.750
We did this and that in the park and at the church, didn't we?

16:26.000 --> 16:27.460
Yeah, something like that.

16:27.750 --> 16:28.250
W-W-W-W-W-W-What does that mean?!

16:30.840 --> 16:34.300
She was hungry and troubled, so I gave her a place to stay...

16:34.800 --> 16:36.180
Yes. That works fine.

16:38.220 --> 16:39.350
Like a stray cat?

16:39.560 --> 16:41.020
Something like that, I guess.

16:42.600 --> 16:44.310
May I have seconds?

16:45.310 --> 16:47.230
The nikujaga is really delicious.

16:55.740 --> 16:57.120
Thank you for the meal.

16:57.160 --> 16:57.870
Y-You're welcome.

16:57.870 --> 16:59.120
Y-You're welcome.

17:01.040 --> 17:01.450
W-What?

17:01.450 --> 17:02.040
W-What?

17:03.830 --> 17:04.620
You pass.

17:06.120 --> 17:09.170
Now I can leave the helpless Yorito to you.

17:09.540 --> 17:11.000
Who's the helpless one?

17:11.840 --> 17:14.050
Both of you seem helpless to me.

17:14.340 --> 17:16.220
He can't take out the trash.

17:16.720 --> 17:18.600
Who's the one making all the trash?!

17:19.010 --> 17:19.970
He's perverted!

17:19.970 --> 17:20.680
I am not!

17:21.140 --> 17:22.270
You doze off sometimes.

17:22.270 --> 17:24.730
But she doesn't seem like a bad person.

17:22.430 --> 17:23.730
Because now I have more to worry about!

17:23.730 --> 17:25.350
You're picky about food.

17:25.350 --> 17:26.900
Whose fault is that?!

17:25.730 --> 17:26.900
Hey, Yorito.

17:26.980 --> 17:27.770
What?

17:28.860 --> 17:31.650
Am I that unreliable?

17:32.360 --> 17:33.110
Mana...

17:33.740 --> 17:36.820
I won't be able to help you if you don't tell me about it.

17:40.530 --> 17:41.410
Um...

17:41.830 --> 17:45.160
I picked up a cat, and it turned into a human and...

17:45.910 --> 17:48.120
That's impossible.

17:48.120 --> 17:51.880
She came from the future to change my life...

17:51.880 --> 17:53.460
Yorito!

17:57.380 --> 18:00.300
I just didn't want my sister to worry.

18:01.140 --> 18:04.560
How surprising. And that's why you hid it from me too?

18:05.140 --> 18:06.770
You're a chatterbox, so...

18:07.140 --> 18:09.520
I keep secrets secret.

18:09.940 --> 18:11.650
Who do you mean by Yorito's sister?

18:13.980 --> 18:15.150
She's in the hospital.

18:15.900 --> 18:18.110
She's been weak since she was little.

18:19.070 --> 18:20.030
I see.

18:21.320 --> 18:22.450
Okay.

18:22.990 --> 18:25.080
I won't ask about your identity any more.

18:25.580 --> 18:27.580
I've already figured out it's for a reason.

18:27.870 --> 18:30.080
I won't talk about this to anybody.

18:31.460 --> 18:32.090
Sorry.

18:34.090 --> 18:36.010
Nice to meet you, Matsuri-san.

18:44.560 --> 18:45.470
You pass.

18:47.980 --> 18:49.270
Thank you for the meal.

18:50.150 --> 18:51.270
Hey, Matsuri!

18:52.440 --> 18:53.820
We haven't finished talking-

18:54.230 --> 18:58.070
I can't disturb the precious time you two have.

18:58.400 --> 18:59.530
Our time?

18:59.530 --> 19:00.780
What is she talking about?

19:15.050 --> 19:17.300
She's kind of eccentric.

19:17.630 --> 19:20.300
Eccentric isn't how I would put it...

19:20.300 --> 19:22.800
I'll go talk with Matsuri-san some more!

19:23.930 --> 19:24.550
H-Hey.

19:28.020 --> 19:29.100
This is getting tiresome...

19:38.360 --> 19:39.070
Huh?

19:40.700 --> 19:41.860
Matsuri-san?

19:42.910 --> 19:43.820
You pass.

19:44.030 --> 19:46.790
Now I can leave the helpless Yorito to you.

19:49.000 --> 19:52.710
Yeah, I told her not to wander off too much.

19:53.290 --> 19:55.000
She should be back soon.

19:55.500 --> 20:00.260
How could you be so careless?! She has no intention of coming back!

20:01.050 --> 20:02.430
Why do you say that?

20:02.550 --> 20:04.180
It's a woman's instinct!

20:04.640 --> 20:06.430
You're so insensitive!

20:06.970 --> 20:08.260
You said "search", but...

20:08.470 --> 20:10.350
She couldn't have gone far!

20:18.610 --> 20:19.320
What's wrong?

20:20.280 --> 20:21.280
Well...

20:23.530 --> 20:25.200
I went to get my stuff.

20:26.410 --> 20:29.910
Since I can't wear borrowed clothes forever.

20:30.500 --> 20:31.750
Geez...

20:32.000 --> 20:33.500
What? Going out on a date?

20:35.080 --> 20:36.580
W-What are you talking about?

20:37.130 --> 20:39.550
Well, you two are lovers, right?

20:40.550 --> 20:41.130
L-Lovers?!

20:41.130 --> 20:42.130
L-Lovers?!

20:42.550 --> 20:43.260
Who are?

20:43.260 --> 20:44.300
Mana and me?

20:44.800 --> 20:46.010
No way!

20:46.970 --> 20:48.100
You aren't?

20:48.720 --> 20:51.220
Yorito is a lonesome bachelor, right?

20:51.220 --> 20:53.140
Look who's talking.

20:53.390 --> 20:54.440
Buzz Buzz!

20:54.890 --> 20:58.520
Even though it may not look like it, but I sometimes get love confessions.

20:58.770 --> 21:00.400
When was the most recent?

21:01.610 --> 21:03.360
Fourth grade...

21:03.530 --> 21:04.530
That's so wrong!

21:05.110 --> 21:06.070
Anyway,

21:06.240 --> 21:09.280
that's how it is, so don't worry about staying here.

21:09.450 --> 21:12.620
R-Right. Then I'll stay a little bit longer.

21:13.200 --> 21:14.910
All right, do your best!

21:14.910 --> 21:15.620
What's that for?

21:16.080 --> 21:17.170
It's not like I...

21:17.750 --> 21:19.250
It's fine, it's fine.

21:19.250 --> 21:20.630
I'm asking you what's fine!

21:35.810 --> 21:39.610
Oh? Hasn't it been a while since Morimiya-kun came to school on time?

21:39.900 --> 21:40.820
Has it?

21:41.730 --> 21:42.360
Hey.

21:42.940 --> 21:43.820
Hey.

21:44.780 --> 21:46.490
Hold on... Why do you only say hello to Mana?

21:46.490 --> 21:49.410
Hold on... Why do you only say hello to Mana?

21:49.410 --> 21:50.660
Suspicious.

21:51.830 --> 21:55.210
Hey, what are you laughing about?

21:55.210 --> 21:55.830
It's a... se-cret!

21:56.870 --> 21:58.920
Suspicious...!

